    "created_at": "2018-08-07T13:24:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-07T13:24:04Z",
    "body": "OK, that wording assumes there is a current Realm.  It's not clear to me whether that's true in the streams case, esp. because the algorithm in question is being called async (unlike `encode`, which is an ES Function and so clearly has a current Realm).",
