    "created_at": "2018-08-07T13:41:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-07T13:41:18Z",
    "body": "This may be an unintended side-effect of supplying the CreateTransformStream() operation for specs to use rather than expecting them to create a _transformer_ object and pass it to the TransformStream constructor.\r\n\r\nI'd like the realm used to be the realm of the constructor, because that's what the polyfill does, and I've convinced myself that behaviour is correct. Can you propose some wording that would make it unambiguous?",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
