    "created_at": "2018-08-07T13:56:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-07T13:56:05Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure what the state of the art is right now for wording for this sort of thing in a non-ecmaspeak context when creating an ES object.  @domenic do you know where things stand with that?\r\n\r\nIf I had to make up something, I would just say to create an ArrayBuffer using the constructor from global X and then create a Uint8Array using the constructor from global X or something, since those constructors have no side-effects, this is more or less ok.",
